From: NWA50BE OpenWrt Project <noreply@invalid.example>
Subject: [PATCH] ipq53xx: keep pstore RAM logging disabled
SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-only

TIP v5.1.1-rc1 enables pstore for EAP105 crash logs in the shared ipq53xx
kernel configuration. On the NWA50BE that binds ramoops to the 1 MiB region
at 0x49c00000, which this board has never written from Linux. Keep the
kernel configuration identical to the image validated on hardware until the
region is tested with UART attached.

---
diff --git a/feeds/qca-wifi-7/ipq53xx/config-6.6 b/feeds/qca-wifi-7/ipq53xx/config-6.6
--- a/feeds/qca-wifi-7/ipq53xx/config-6.6
+++ b/feeds/qca-wifi-7/ipq53xx/config-6.6
@@ -1412,7 +1412,3 @@
 # CONFIG_USB_SERIAL_XR is not set
 CONFIG_GPIO_WATCHDOG=y
 CONFIG_GPIO_WATCHDOG_ARCH_INITCALL=y
-CONFIG_PSTORE=y
-CONFIG_PSTORE_CONSOLE=y
-CONFIG_PSTORE_PMSG=y
-CONFIG_PSTORE_RAM=y
